      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T19:20:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure Request is the right work here. Like is this covering when a client gives us an SkImage/Surface that already has data in it? Then I would just say kClient or kClientProvided.\n\nAdditionally do we need some kUnknown source as well? Like what happens when you start capturing and the client had already made an SkImage from a snapshot before starting capture? And then uses that SkImage during the capture.",
