      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T18:13:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We might need kUnknown, but not for that. When capture is enabled at SkContext creation, even before we capture, we a re always making PixelStorages and tracking where their provenance. We will probably want kUnknown just in case we need a default while we round out the type.\n\nkClientRequest is when the client explicitly asks for an SkSurface to be created from a Recorder (they call a Make function).\n\nI added kUnknown, let me know if you can think of a better name for kClientRequest or if that works given the context.",
